 "ai_positioning_fr": {
  "summary_fr": "AMETEK mentionne l'intelligence artificielle dans ses efforts de R&D et de d\u00e9veloppement de produits innovants, int\u00e9gr\u00e9e aux m\u00e9thodologies Design for Six Sigma et Value Analysis/Value Engineering.",
  "evidence_fr": [
   {
    "text_fr": "AMETEK a constamment augment\u00e9 ses investissements en recherche, d\u00e9veloppement et ing\u00e9nierie, et a am\u00e9lior\u00e9 ses efforts de d\u00e9veloppement de nouveaux produits gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l'adoption des m\u00e9thodologies Design for Six Sigma et Value Analysis/Value Engineering ainsi que des outils d'intelligence artificielle.",
    "source": "AMETEK has consistently added to its investment in research, development and engineering, and improved its new product development efforts with the adoption of Design for Six Sigma and Value Analysis/Value Engineering methodologies along with artificial intelligence tools."
